    "media:imagetext": "FOR INFORMATION OR RESERVATIONS CALL\nYOUR TRAVEL AGENT OR UNITED AIR LINES.\nSan Francisco.\nEX 7-2100\nOakland\n834-5600\nHayward.\n..JE 8-7600\nMarin County.\nDU 8-3774\nPalo Alto - Mountain View\n967-6993\nRichmond.\nSan Jose.\nSan Mateo..\nWalnut Creek..\nBE 5-7300\n..241-8665\nOX 7-7000\nYE 4-1600\nRedwood City\n. EM 6-8201\nYou can check your baggage directly to destination trom the\nAirline Terminal and obtain check-in, including seat reserva-\ntion and selection as applicable, and ground transportation to\nSan Francisco International Airport available at:\nDowntown Airline Terminal\n375 O'Farrell Street, San Francisco\nDECEMBER-1963\nJANUARY-1964\nSM TW T FS\nSM TW T FS\n1\n2\n3\n4\n6\n7\n1\n2\n3\n4\n9\n10\n11\n12\n13\n14\n7\n10\n11\n15\n16\n17\n18\n19\n20\n21\n12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n18\n22\n23\n24\n25\n26\n27\n28\n19\n20\n21\n22\n23\n24\n25\n29\n30\n31\n26\n27\n28\n29\n30\n31\nHalf-Fare Family Plan is available daily except Sunday. Consult United or your travel\n3968-SFO-12/63\nagent for details.\n1999.015.145\nFAR AHEAD\nON JET FREIGHT LIFT\n...plus top Cargoliner service\n(see schedules inside back cover)\nPrinted in U.S.A.",
