    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nEFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1, 1963\nUNITED\n• On United...\nNEW LOW FARE\nTO HAWAII\nSAVE $66 Round Trip\n(see map page)",
      "FOR INFORMATION OR RESERVATIONS CALL\nYOUR TRAVEL AGENT OR UNITED AIR LINES.\nSan Francisco.\nEX 7-2100\nOakland\n834-5600\nHayward.\n..JE 8-7600\nMarin County.\nDU 8-3774\nPalo Alto - Mountain View\n967-6993\nRichmond.\nSan Jose.\nSan Mateo..\nWalnut Creek..\nBE 5-7300\n..241-8665\nOX 7-7000\nYE 4-1600\nRedwood City\n. EM 6-8201\nYou can check your baggage directly to destination trom the\nAirline Terminal and obtain check-in, including seat reserva-\ntion and selection as applicable, and ground transportation to\nSan Francisco International Airport available at:\nDowntown Airline Terminal\n375 O'Farrell Street, San Francisco\nDECEMBER-1963\nJANUARY-1964\nSM TW T FS\nSM TW T FS\n1\n2\n3\n4\n6\n7\n1\n2\n3\n4\n9\n10\n11\n12\n13\n14\n7\n10\n11\n15\n16\n17\n18\n19\n20\n21\n12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n18\n22\n23\n24\n25\n26\n27\n28\n19\n20\n21\n22\n23\n24\n25\n29\n30\n31\n26\n27\n28\n29\n30\n31\nHalf-Fare Family Plan is available daily except Sunday. Consult United or your travel\n3968-SFO-12/63\nagent for details.\n1999.015.145\nFAR AHEAD\nON JET FREIGHT LIFT\n...plus top Cargoliner service\n(see schedules inside back cover)\nPrinted in U.S.A.",
      "HONOLULU\nPORTLAND\nSALE\nEUGENE\nMEDFORD\nRENO\nSAN FRANCISCO/\nOAKLAND\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMONTEREY\nSALINAS\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nSAN DIEGO\nANCOUVER, B.C.\nILE ITACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nELKO\nELY\nLAS VEGAS\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nUNITED FLIES BY ELGIN WATCH TIME\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE/TACOMA\nNEW YORK\n› PHILADELPHIA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nWASHINGTO\nLOS ANGELES\nOLULU\nMINNEAPOLIS /ST. PAUL\nMILWAUKEE\nSAGINAW BAY CIFY MIDLAND\nMUSKEGO:\nFLINT\nROCHESTER\nBOSTON\nHARTFORD /SPRINGFIELD\nEMIRA/CORNIN\nPROVIDENCE\nGRAND RAPIDS\nDETROIT\nWILLIAMSE\nCEDAR\nDES MOINES\nOMAHA\nHICAGO\nTOLEDO\nSOUTH BEND AKRON CANT\nFORT WAYNE\nPITTSBURG\nYOUNGSTOWN WARRE\nNEW YORK\nNEWARK\nG/ YOR\nPHILADELPHIA\nMOLINE DAVENPORT /ROCK ISLAND\nDAYTON\nCOLUMBUS\nLINCOLN\nCHARLESTON, W. VA\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS HAMPTON\nWILLIAMSBURG\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOL /KINGSPORT/JOHNSON CIT\nKANSAS Of\nGREENSBORO HIGH POINT\nWINSTON-SALEM\nRALEIGH /DURHAM\nKNOXVILL\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOG/\nCHARLOTTE\nMEMPHIS\nHUNTSVIMLE\nATLANTA\nKIKMINGHA\nJACKSONVILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA\nST. PETERSBURG/\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nHawaii Now . ..\nand United makes it easier than ever\nIn addition to our new low jet fare which saves\nyou $66 on a round trip, United offers jet service\nto the enchanted Islands of Hawaii from more\nU.S. cities than any other airline. So plan to\nspend this winter in the beautiful \"Paradise of\nthe Pacific\", and be sure to include all of the\nIslands in your itinerary.\nYour Travel Agent or your local United office will\nbe happy to make all of your arrangements.\nUNITED\nTHE EXTRA CARE AIRLINE"
